Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Prehistoric life...{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}It is a general term for organisms that once inhabited the Earth.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}After death, over a long period of time,{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.13,0:00:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}they turned into fossils within the strata.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Paleontology. It is the study of fossils, {\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1} exploring mechanisms such as biological evolution and interactions with the environment...{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down! Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you're way too loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.73,0:00:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the club president, Tetori Kitadani!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Paleontology Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a prospective member, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kanna Nakazato from the Idol Research Club next door!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold! This is an ammonite fossil that I excavated!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:00:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.23,0:01:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ammonites were amazing prehistoric creatures that thrived in oceans all over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, the strata where these fossils are found are mainly Mesozoic, proving that other organisms excavated in the same layer lived in the same era!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, for paleontology, ammonites are key index fossils that tell us the era!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.70,0:01:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,An index fossil that reveals the era...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You accepted the fossil! Now, welcome to the world of SERIOUS PALEONTOLOGY!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-What is happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,EXPLOSION! Prehistoric Silhouette Quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't get every question right, you have to join the club!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.57,0:02:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,EH?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes Question 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.63,0:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Which dinosaur is this silhouette?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.47,0:02:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? How should I know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out! Can you solve this question?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, jeez... A Tyrannosaurus... or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I just named the only dinosaur I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tyrannosaurus reconstruction unveiled in 2014!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold its feather-covered body!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wasn't Tyrannosaurus,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,supposed to look different?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That is an outdated theory!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is becoming the mainstream view today!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Theories about dinosaurs advance every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the true thrill of paleontology!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:02:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,FINAL QUESTION!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Which dinosaur is this silhouette?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Another super hard one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There are over 1,000 species of dinosaurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you get it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's way too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me! Or join the club!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I really have no clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1 until you join...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyrannosaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I should be asking that! Why is it the same answer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In 1920,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,it happened the world's first Tyrannosaurus reconstruction, made by Henry Osborn, the man who named it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,BUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:04:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As researchers studied other fossils and skeletal structures, the idea that they stood parallel to the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.43,0:04:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,became the consensus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A prehistoric creature and a true idol of the dinosaur world...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,THIS WAS...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyrannosaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyrannosaurus...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol of the dinosaur world...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my loss...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but I won...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It’s a myriad of things that change over time and with the urgencies of everyday life...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.23,0:04:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear someone muttering inside the locker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}H-How can you hear that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.07,0:04:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, w-wait{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, sorry for intruding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT IS THAT???
